Cart + Checkout Android API test evidence
Date: 2026-09-02
Command: ./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest :app:assembleDebug --no-daemon
Result: BUILD SUCCESSFUL

Tests execute the Android PlatformApi implementation against OkHttp MockWebServer:
- PlatformApiCartCheckoutTest.cartBuildsAuthenticatedGetAndParsesItems
  GET /api/platform/cart -> HTTP 200; verifies Bearer token, x-tenant-id, cart id/status, item product id, and totalCents.
- PlatformApiCartCheckoutTest.addCartItemBuildsAuthenticatedPostWithExpectedJson
  POST /api/platform/cart/items -> HTTP 201; verifies Bearer token, x-tenant-id, productId, quantity, branchId, and cartId parsing.
- PlatformApiCartCheckoutTest.checkoutBuildsAuthenticatedPostAndParsesOrderState
  POST /api/platform/cart/checkout -> HTTP 201; verifies Bearer token, x-tenant-id, branchId, orderId, state=PENDING, totalCents, and currency.

The Compose UI invokes addCartItem(), cart(), and checkout() from the same Android PlatformApi class. The checkout result is rendered with orderId and state.
